<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="Job Execution" id="job-seq"><mxGraphModel dx="2000" dy="1400" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2000" pageHeight="1400" background="#ffffff"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
<mxCell id="t" value="JOB SCHEDULER - Job Execution Flow (Schedule → Enqueue → Execute → Heartbeat → Complete → Retry on Failure)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1a237e" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="20" width="1840" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="subtitle" value="5 Phases: (1) Job Creation ~100ms | (2) Scheduler Enqueue every 30s | (3) Worker ZPOPMIN atomic pickup &lt; 1ms | (4) Execution with heartbeat every 30s | (5) Completion + Next Schedule" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#e8eaf6;align=center;rounded=1;fontSize=12" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="65" width="1800" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="user" value="User / API" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#bbdefb;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="ul1" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#1976d2;strokeColor=#1976d2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="125" y="220" width="10" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="apiSvc" value="API Service" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="apiLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#388e3c;strokeColor=#388e3c" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="325" y="220" width="10" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="cassandra" value="Cassandra" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="cassLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#7b1fa2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525" y="220" width="10" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="scheduler" value="Scheduler Svc&#10;(Leader)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcc80;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="schedLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#ef6c00;strokeColor=#ef6c00" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="725" y="220" width="10" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="redis" value="Redis&#10;(Queue + Locks)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="redisLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#f57f17;strokeColor=#f57f17" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="925" y="220" width="10" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="worker" value="Worker Pod" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="workerLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#388e3c;strokeColor=#388e3c" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1125" y="220" width="10" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="jobLogic" value="Job Logic&#10;(External)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="jobLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#388e3c;strokeColor=#388e3c" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1325" y="220" width="10" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="monitor" value="Monitor Svc" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="monLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#7b1fa2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1525" y="220" width="10" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase1" value="PHASE 1: JOB CREATION" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#1976d2;fillColor=#e3f2fd;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="230" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s1" value="1. POST /jobs&#10;{cron: '0 2 * * *'}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#1976d2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="ul1" target="apiLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="135" y="260" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="315" y="260" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s2" value="2. INSERT INTO jobs&#10;(job_id, next_run_at=2026-08-22 02:00)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="apiLine" target="cassLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3" value="3. OK, job_id" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cassLine" target="apiLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s4" value="4. 201 Created&#10;{job_id, next_run}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#1976d2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="apiLine" target="ul1"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase2" value="PHASE 2: SCHEDULER ENQUEUE (every 30s)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#ef6c00;fillColor=#fff3e0;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="390" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s5" value="5. SELECT jobs WHERE&#10;next_run_at &lt; now()+60s&#10;AND status='ACTIVE'" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="schedLine" target="cassLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s6" value="6. [job_id, payload,&#10;next_run_at]" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cassLine" target="schedLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s7" value="7. ZADD job_queue&#10;score=next_run_ts&#10;member=job_id" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="schedLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s8" value="8. OK (added 127 jobs)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="schedLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase3" value="PHASE 3: WORKER PICKUP (ZPOPMIN atomic, &lt; 1ms)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fillColor=#e8f5e9;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="530" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s9" value="9. ZPOPMIN job_queue 1&#10;(atomic pop)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="workerLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s10" value="10. {job_id, score}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="workerLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s11" value="11. SELECT * FROM jobs&#10;WHERE job_id=X" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="workerLine" target="cassLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s12" value="12. {payload, timeout,&#10;max_retries}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="cassLine" target="workerLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s13" value="13. INSERT execution&#10;(exec_id, status=RUNNING,&#10;started_at=now())" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="workerLine" target="cassLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s14" value="14. SET job_heartbeat:{id}&#10;workerId EX 90" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="workerLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase4" value="PHASE 4: EXECUTION + HEARTBEAT (long-running)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fillColor=#e8f5e9;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="740" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s15" value="15. execute(payload)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="workerLine" target="jobLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note1" value="Job runs for 5 minutes..." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#757575;fillColor=#eeeeee;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="795" width="160" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s16" value="16. (every 30s)&#10;SETEX job_heartbeat:{id}&#10;workerId EX 90" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#f57f17;dashed=1;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="workerLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s17" value="17. (every 30s loop)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="workerLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s18" value="18. result" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="jobLine" target="workerLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase5" value="PHASE 5: COMPLETION + NEXT SCHEDULE (CRON)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#1976d2;fillColor=#e3f2fd;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="940" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s19" value="19. UPDATE execution&#10;SET status=SUCCESS,&#10;finished_at=now()" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="workerLine" target="cassLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s20" value="20. UPDATE jobs SET&#10;next_run_at=&#10;compute_next(cron)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="workerLine" target="cassLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s21" value="21. DEL job_heartbeat:{id}&#10;(cleanup)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="workerLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase6" value="FAILURE SCENARIO: Worker Crash Detection" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#c62828;fillColor=#ffebee;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1640" y="1050" width="300" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note2" value="Worker crashes at t=60s&#10;(no more heartbeat renewal)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#c62828;fillColor=#ffebee;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="1075" width="180" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s22" value="22. (t=120s) GET&#10;job_heartbeat:{id}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="monLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s23" value="23. nil (TTL expired)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="monLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s24" value="24. UPDATE execution&#10;SET status=FAILED" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="monLine" target="cassLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s25" value="25. ZADD job_queue&#10;score=now+backoff(1s)&#10;(retry attempt 1)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="monLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="interview" value="INTERVIEW KEY QUESTIONS&#10;&#10;Q1: How do you prevent two workers from executing the same job?&#10;A1: Redis ZPOPMIN is atomic. Only one worker gets each job_id. Redis guarantees single-pop per member even under concurrent calls.&#10;&#10;Q2: What happens if a worker crashes mid-execution?&#10;A2: Worker stops renewing heartbeat. After 90s TTL expires, Monitor Service detects missing heartbeat, marks execution FAILED, creates new execution_id, and re-enqueues job to Redis with exponential backoff delay.&#10;&#10;Q3: How do you handle thundering herd (10K jobs at midnight)?&#10;A3: Deterministic jitter: next_run = cron_computed_time + (hash(job_id) % 300 seconds). Spreads jobs over 5 minutes. Same job always gets same jitter offset.&#10;&#10;Q4: Why Redis sorted set instead of Kafka for the queue?&#10;A4: Kafka is FIFO. Cannot query 'give me all jobs due NOW' regardless of insertion order. Redis ZSET has score = unix_timestamp, ZRANGEBYSCORE returns all due jobs in O(log N). ZPOPMIN gives time-based priority.&#10;&#10;Q5: Why leader election for Scheduler Service?&#10;A5: Without it, all Scheduler instances would ZADD same job to Redis → duplicate enqueues → same job runs N times. Leader election (Redis SETNX with TTL) ensures only one instance enqueues.&#10;&#10;Q6: What is the difference between at-least-once and exactly-once?&#10;A6: At-least-once: job may run twice on worker crash (original + retry). Jobs must be idempotent. Exactly-once: distributed lock (Redis SETNX) before execution — only one worker can hold lock. Trade-off: exactly-once adds complexity + lock contention.&#10;&#10;Q7: How do you handle jobs that exceed max_retries?&#10;A7: Mark status=DEAD_LETTER. Alert ops team. No more automatic retries. Requires manual investigation (check logs, fix payload, POST /jobs/{id}/retry).&#10;&#10;Q8: How do you compute next_run_at for cron jobs?&#10;A8: Parse cron expression (e.g., '0 2 * * *' = 2am daily). Use Quartz library to compute next valid timestamp. Add deterministic jitter. UPDATE jobs.next_run_at. Scheduler picks it up in next polling cycle (within 30s)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1160" width="1880" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
